        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-29",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "The goods are now in the store, as a delivery at that cost.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-09/19.wav",
            "dur": 3.559
          }
        }
      ],
      "checklist": [],
      "outro": {
        "text": "If less came than was ordered, type what came. Both stay on the record.",
        "voice": "a9/voice/A9-09/20.wav",
        "dur": 4.842
      },
      "next": "Equipment"
    },
    {
      "id": "A9-10",
      "slug": "A9-10-equipment",
      "section": "A9.13",
      "title": "Equipment",
      "intro": {
        "text": "Equipment is the register of durable things. In this video you will add an AC, ask for it to leave the store, and approve it.",
        "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/01.wav",
        "dur": 8.035
      },
      "record": null,
      "scenes": [
        {
          "shot": "A9-31",
          "focus": null,
          "line": {
            "text": "Open Equipment, tap Add an item, and type what it is.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/02.wav",
            "dur": 4.081
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-31",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Its category: one this property already uses, or a new one.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/03.wav",
            "dur": 4.012
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-31",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "Keep track of it one by one, with a tag. Cheaper things can be a count in one place.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/04.wav",
            "dur": 5.388
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-31",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "The next free tag number is offered.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/05.wav",
            "dur": 2.189
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-31",
          "focus": 5,
          "line": {
            "text": "Say where it is: a room, or another place, such as the main store.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/06.wav",
            "dur": 4.766
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-32",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "Add the cost if you know it. A blank shows a dash, never zero.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/07.wav",
            "dur": 4.378
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-32",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "And the warranty and service contract dates, if you have them.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/08.wav",
            "dur": 3.466
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-32",
          "focus": 6,
          "line": {
            "text": "Tap Add. Its page opens.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/09.wav",
            "dur": 2.613
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-33",
          "focus": 6,
          "line": {
            "text": "What has happened to it is listed here, newest first.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/10.wav",
            "dur": 3.408
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-34",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Report a repair raises a repair. The item shows as under repair until the repair is closed.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/11.wav",
            "dur": 6.015
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-35",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "Anybody who can see it may ask for it to leave the store. Here, reception taps Ask to take out.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/12.wav",
            "dur": 6.003
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-36",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "Choose the room.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/13.wav",
            "dur": 1.109
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-36",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "It stays in the store until the Inventory Manager approves it.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/14.wav",
            "dur": 3.443
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-36",
          "focus": 4,
          "line": {
            "text": "Say why. Then tap Ask.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/15.wav",
            "dur": 2.497
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-37",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "On Equipment, the Inventory Manager sees the request waiting.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/16.wav",
            "dur": 3.965
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-37",
          "focus": 2,
          "line": {
            "text": "And taps Approve. Or Refuse, saying why.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/17.wav",
            "dur": 3.646
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-38",
          "focus": 1,
          "line": {
            "text": "Approved, it is now in room 205.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/18.wav",
            "dur": 3.187
          }
        },
        {
          "shot": "A9-38",
          "focus": 3,
          "line": {
            "text": "Its history shows the request, who approved it, and when.",
            "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/19.wav",
            "dur": 3.733
          }
        }
      ],
      "checklist": [],
      "outro": {
        "text": "A move between rooms, or back into a store, needs nobody's approval. That is the Store and purchasing. Thank you for watching.",
        "voice": "a9/voice/A9-10/20.wav",
        "dur": 8.691
      },
      "next": null
    }
  ]
